[36m(TaskRunner pid=139336)[0m # State Schema
[36m(TaskRunner pid=139336)[0m - `state`: one of `CANDIDATE_SEARCH`, `CANDIDATE_SELECT`, or `DECISION`.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=139336)[0m - `query`: the original user request. The harness does not parse it for you.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=139336)[0m - `allowed_tools`: valid tools for this turn.
